<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia cash values were unchanged Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Diammonium phosphate demand was moderate as cooperatives and other farm stores enlarged inventories ahead of autumn applications. Ammonia markets were quiet.</p>
<p>				 Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-187		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
